          "text": "Toenail symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Toenail changes for approximately 18/12; mild discomfort in shoes and cosmetic bother. No pain, discharge, or spreading erythema."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
